---
<section class="faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header animate-fadeUp">
      <div class="chip">❓ Common Questions</div>
      <h2>Answers to Your Moving Questions</h2>
      <p>Everything you need to know about your next move with PackersHub.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-accordion animate-fadeUp">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn">
          <span>How much do packers and movers cost in South India?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>Local moves start from ₹3,999 and intercity relocations begin at ₹7,999. The final price depends on distance, volume of goods, services selected, and floor access. We always provide a fixed, transparent quote after a free survey — no hidden fees ever.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn">
          <span>Is PackersHub IBA approved and government verified?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>Yes! PackersHub is a fully IBA-approved moving company and is government-registered. All our staff are police-verified and we carry all required licenses and permits to operate across South India.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn">
          <span>Do you provide insurance for goods during transit?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>Absolutely. All our moves come with transit insurance coverage up to ₹20 lakh depending on the plan. Additional insurance can be purchased for high-value items.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn">
          <span>How far in advance should I book my move?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>We recommend booking at least 7-10 days in advance for intercity moves and 3-5 days for local moves. However, we also offer emergency 24-hour moving services for urgent relocations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn">
          <span>What happens if my goods are damaged during the move?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>PackersHub offers a 100% Damage-Free Guarantee. If any item is damaged due to our handling, we replace or compensate for it — no questions asked.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-section { padding: 80px 0; background: var(--bg); }
  .faq-accordion { max-width: 800px; margin: 40px auto 0; }
  .faq-item {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .faq-btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 24px 32px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .faq-icon {
    width: 28px; height: 28px;
    background: var(--bg-section);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 20px; transition: all 0.3s;
  }
  .faq-item.active .faq-icon {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .faq-content {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.4s;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .faq-item.active .faq-content { max-height: 500px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .faq-content p { padding: 24px 32px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.65; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .faq-btn { padding: 20px 24px; font-size: 15px; }
    .faq-content p { padding: 20px 24px; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-btn').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const item = btn.parentElement;
      const isActive = item?.classList.contains('active');
      
      document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('active'));
      
      if (!isActive) {
        item?.classList.add('active');
      }
    });
  });
</script>
